OL,3,GNEWSAPupils forge art from knives in
OL,4,Aanti-crime project
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents in Rugby have taken part in a
OL,7,Fproject to tackle knife crime by
OL,8,Fcreating a sculpture made from
OL,9,Fconfiscated weapons.
OL,11,FPupils at Ashlawn School worked with a
OL,12,Fprofessional blacksmith to learn how
OL,13,Fknives could be melted down and
OL,14,Ftransformed into a depiction of a
OL,15,Fphoenix surrounded by knife handles.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
