OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAPupils forge art from knives in
OL,4,Aanti-crime project
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs part of the school's Cut the Cycle
OL,7,Fproject, the artwork was forged from
OL,8,Fblades that had been handed into
OL,9,Famnesty bins, and was developed through
OL,10,FWarwickshire Crimebeat's Young High
OL,11,FSheriff Programme after students
OL,12,Fidentified knife crime as an issue they
OL,13,Fwanted to address.
OL,15,F"What makes this project so impressive
OL,16,Fis that it has been driven by students
OL,17,Fthemselves," said Sgt Guy Mountford.
